hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"12","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hajj kiya; jab wo Madinah pahunche — jabke Sa'id bin Al-Aas aur Abdullah bin Az-Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) baithe hue the — jab wo un dono ke paas pahunche to Sa'id bin Al-Aas [isteqbal ke liye] khade ho gaye, to Muawiyah ne kaha: Tumhara bhai tum se zyada deen samajhta hai. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Jise ye khush kare ke log use aata dekh kar us ke liye khade ho jayen to Allah us ke liye jahannam mein ek ghar banayega.'"
